Johto_Route34_Route34_Text_YoungsterSamuel_Seen:
	.string "Hey! I'm looking for MANKEY!$"

Johto_Route34_Route34_Text_YoungsterSamuel_Beaten:
	.string "Beaten by a passing stranger!$"

Johto_Route34_Route34_Text_YoungsterSamuel_After:
	.string "I'm going to train even harder.\p"
	.string "After all, I'm trying to become\n"
	.string "a GYM LEADER.$"

Johto_Route34_Route34_Text_YoungsterIan_Seen:
	.string "I'm the best in my class at\n"
	.string "POKéMON.$"

Johto_Route34_Route34_Text_YoungsterIan_Beaten:
	.string "No! There are better trainers…$"

Johto_Route34_Route34_Text_YoungsterIan_After:
	.string "I'm trying hard so I can be the\n"
	.string "star in my class.$"

Johto_Route34_Route34_Text_CamperTodd_Seen:
	.string "I'm confident in my ability to\n"
	.string "raise POKéMON.\p"
	.string "Want to see?$"

Johto_Route34_Route34_Text_CamperTodd_Beaten:
	.string "Did I screw up my training?$"

Johto_Route34_Route34_Text_CamperTodd_After:
	.string "Maybe I should take one to DAY-CARE,\n"
	.string "or maybe use some items…$"

Johto_Route34_Route34_Text_PicnickerGina_Seen:
	.string "Are you a TRAINER?\p"
	.string "Let's have a practice battle.$"

Johto_Route34_Route34_Text_PicnickerGina_Beaten:
	.string "Oh, no! I just can't win…$"

Johto_Route34_Route34_Text_PicnickerGina_After:
	.string "You're too strong to be a\n"
	.string "practice partner.$"

Johto_Route34_Route34_Text_OfficerKeith_Seen:
	.string "Who goes there?\n"
	.string "What are you up to?$"

Johto_Route34_Route34_Text_OfficerKeith_Win:
	.string "You're a tough little kid.$"

Johto_Route34_Route34_Text_OfficerKeith_After:
	.string "Yep, nothing wrong today.\p"
	.string "Be good and stay out of trouble.$"

Johto_Route34_Route34_Text_OfficerKeith_Daytime:
	.string "I'm on patrol for suspicious\n"
	.string "individuals.$"

Johto_Route34_Route34_Text_PokefanBrandon_Seen:
	.string "I just got my POKéMON back from\n"
	.string "DAY-CARE.\p"
	.string "Let's see how much stronger it got!$"

Johto_Route34_Route34_Text_PokefanBrandon_Beaten:
	.string "Why does it end this way?$"

Johto_Route34_Route34_Text_PokefanBrandon_After:
	.string "My POKéMON came back with new moves.\p"
	.string "That confounded me to no end!$"

Johto_Route34_Route34_Text_Sign_IlexForest:
	.string "ILEX FOREST\n"
