Johto_GoldenrodCity_UndergroundSwitches_GoldenrodUnderground_Text_SilverBefore:
    .string "Hold it!\p"
    .string "I saw you, so I tailed you.\p"
    .string "I don't need you underfoot while I\n"
    .string "take care of TEAM ROCKET.\p"
    .string "…Wait a second. You beat me before,\n"
    .string "didn't you?\p"
    .string "That was just a fluke.\p"
    .string "I've been training my team and now\n"
    .string "I will repay my debts!$"

Johto_GoldenrodCity_UndergroundSwitches_GoldenrodUnderground_Text_SilverWin:
    .string "…Why… Why do I lose?\p"
    .string "I've assembled the toughest POKéMON.\p"
    .string "I didn't ease up on the gas.\p"
    .string "So why do I lose?$"

Johto_GoldenrodCity_UndergroundSwitches_GoldenrodUnderground_Text_SilverAfter:
    .string "…I don't understand…\p"
    .string "Is what that LANCE guy said true?\p"
    .string "That I don't treat POKéMON properly?\p"
    .string "Love…\p"
    .string "Trust…\p"
    .string "Are they really what I lack?\p"
    .string "Are they keeping me from winning?\p"
    .string "I… I just don't understand.\p"
    .string "But it's not going to end here.\p"
    .string "Not now. Not because of this.\p"
    .string "I won't give up my dream of becoming\n"
    .string "the world's best POKéMON trainer!$"

Johto_GoldenrodCity_UndergroundSwitches_GoldenrodUnderground_Text_SilverLoss:
    .string "Humph. This is my real power, wimp.\p"
    .string "I'll make TEAM ROCKET history.\p"
    .string "And I'm going to grind that LANCE\n"
    .string "under my heels.$"

Johto_GoldenrodCity_UndergroundSwitches_GoldenrodUnderground_Text_GruntM11Seen:
    .string "Open one shutter, another closes.\p"
    .string "Bet you can't get where you want!$"

Johto_GoldenrodCity_UndergroundSwitches_GoldenrodUnderground_Text_GruntM11Beaten:
    .string "Drat! I was sunk by indecision!$"

Johto_GoldenrodCity_UndergroundSwitches_GoldenrodUnderground_Text_GruntM11After:
    .string "I'm confused too… The switch on the\n"
    .string "end is the one to press first, but…$"

Johto_GoldenrodCity_UndergroundSwitches_GoldenrodUnderground_Text_GruntM25Seen:
    .string "Kwahaha!\p"
    .string "Confounded by the shutters, are we?\p"
    .string "I'll let you in on a secret if you\n"
    .string "can beat me!$"

Johto_GoldenrodCity_UndergroundSwitches_GoldenrodUnderground_Text_GruntM25Beaten:
    .string "Uwww… I blew it.$"

Johto_GoldenrodCity_UndergroundSwitches_GoldenrodUnderground_Text_GruntM25After:
    .string "All right. A hint!\p"
    .string "Change the order of switching.\p"
    .string "That'll change the ways the shutters\n"
    .string "open and close.$"

Johto_GoldenrodCity_UndergroundSwitches_GoldenrodUnderground_Text_BurglarDuncanSeen:
    .string "Fork over your goodies!$"

Johto_GoldenrodCity_UndergroundSwitches_GoldenrodUnderground_Text_BurglarDuncanBeaten:
    .string "Mercy!$"

Johto_GoldenrodCity_UndergroundSwitches_GoldenrodUnderground_Text_BurglarDuncanAfter:
    .string "Steal and sell! That's basic in\n"
    .string "crime, kid!$"

Johto_GoldenrodCity_UndergroundSwitches_GoldenrodUnderground_Text_BurglarEddieSeen:
    .string "They ditched this project before they\n"
    .string "finished.\p"
    .string "I'm searching for leftover loot.$"

Johto_GoldenrodCity_UndergroundSwitches_GoldenrodUnderground_Text_BurglarEddieBeaten:
    .string "Over the top!$"

Johto_GoldenrodCity_UndergroundSwitches_GoldenrodUnderground_Text_BurglarEddieAfter:
    .string "UNDERGROUND WAREHOUSE?\p"
    .string "What do you want to go there for?\p"
    .string "There's nothing down there.$"

Johto_GoldenrodCity_UndergroundSwitches_GoldenrodUnderground_Text_GruntM13Seen:
    .string "I don't care if you're lost.\p"
    .string "You show up here, you're nothing but\n"
    .string "a victim!$"

Johto_GoldenrodCity_UndergroundSwitches_GoldenrodUnderground_Text_GruntM13Beaten:
    .string "Urk! Yeah, think you're cool, huh?$"

Johto_GoldenrodCity_UndergroundSwitches_GoldenrodUnderground_Text_GruntM13After:
    .string "You must have ice in your veins to\n"
    .string "dis TEAM ROCKET.$"

Johto_GoldenrodCity_UndergroundSwitches_GoldenrodUnderground_Text_GruntF3Seen:
    .string "Are you lost? No, you can't be.\p"
    .string "You don't have that scared look.\p"
    .string "I'll give you something to be\n"
    .string "scared about!$"

Johto_GoldenrodCity_UndergroundSwitches_GoldenrodUnderground_Text_GruntF3Beaten:
    .string "How could you?$"

Johto_GoldenrodCity_UndergroundSwitches_GoldenrodUnderground_Text_GruntF3After:
    .string "Go wherever you'd like! Get lost!\n"
    .string "See if I care!$"

Johto_GoldenrodCity_UndergroundSwitches_GoldenrodUnderground_Text_Switch1:
    .string "SWITCH 1 activated.$"

Johto_GoldenrodCity_UndergroundSwitches_GoldenrodUnderground_Text_Switch2:
    .string "SWITCH 2 activated.$"

