Johto_GoldenrodCity_Gym_GoldenrodCity_Gym_Text_GymStatue:
	.string "GOLDENROD POKéMON GYM$"

Johto_GoldenrodCity_Gym_GoldenrodCity_Gym_Text_GymStatueCertified:
	.string "GOLDENROD TOWN POKéMON GYM\p"
	.string "WHITNEY'S CERTIFIED TRAINERS:\n"
	.string "{PLAYER}$"

Johto_GoldenrodCity_Gym_GoldenrodCity_Gym_Text_WhitneyBefore:
    .string "Hi! I'm WHITNEY!\p"
    .string "Everyone was into POKéMON, so I got\n"
    .string "into it too!\p"
    .string "POKéMON are super-cute!\p"
    .string "You want to battle? I'm warning\n"
    .string "you- I'm good!$"

Johto_GoldenrodCity_Gym_GoldenrodCity_Gym_Text_WhitneyShouldntBeSoSerious:
    .string "Sob…\p"
    .string "…Waaaaaaah! You're mean!\p"
    .string "You shouldn't be so serious! You…\n"
    .string "you child, you!$"

Johto_GoldenrodCity_Gym_GoldenrodCity_Gym_Text_WhitneyYouMeanie:
    .string "Waaaaah!\p"
    .string "Waaaaah!\p"
    .string "…Snivel, hic… …You meanie!$"

Johto_GoldenrodCity_Gym_GoldenrodCity_Gym_Text_WhitneyWhatDoYouWant:
    .string "…Sniff…\p"
    .string "What? What do you want? A BADGE?\p"
    .string "Oh, right. I forgot. Here's\n"
    .string "PLAINBADGE.$"

Johto_GoldenrodCity_Gym_GoldenrodCity_Gym_Text_PlayerReceivedPlainBadge:
    .string "{PLAYER} received PLAINBADGE.$"

Johto_GoldenrodCity_Gym_GoldenrodCity_Gym_Text_WhitneyPlainBadge:
    .string "PLAINBADGE lets your POKéMON use\n"
    .string "STRENGTH outside of battle.\p"
    .string "It also boosts your POKéMON's\n"
	.string "DEFENSE.\p"
    .string "Oh, you can have this too!$"

Johto_GoldenrodCity_Gym_GoldenrodCity_Gym_Text_WhitneyAttract:
    .string "It's ATTRACT! It makes full use of a\n"
    .string "POKéMON's charm.\p"
    .string "Isn't it just perfect for a cutie\n"
    .string "like me?$"

Johto_GoldenrodCity_Gym_GoldenrodCity_Gym_Text_WhitneyGoodCry:
    .string "Ah, that was a good cry!$"

Johto_GoldenrodCity_Gym_GoldenrodCity_Gym_Text_WhitneyRematch:
    .string "Hi! It's you!\p"
    .string "Wow, JOHTO CHAMPION now?\p"
    .string "You really are amazing!\p"
    .string "I want to see how strong you are.\p"
    .string "Want to have a rematch with me?$"

Johto_GoldenrodCity_Gym_GoldenrodCity_Gym_Text_WhitneyRematchDefeat:
    .string "Waaaaah!\p"
    .string "Waaaaah!\p"
    .string "…Snivel, hic… …You meanie!$"

Johto_GoldenrodCity_Gym_GoldenrodCity_Gym_Text_LassCarrieSeen:
    .string "Don't let my POKéMON's cute looks\n"
    .string "fool you.\p"
    .string "They can whip you!$"

Johto_GoldenrodCity_Gym_GoldenrodCity_Gym_Text_LassCarrieBeaten:
    .string "Darn… I thought you were weak…$"

Johto_GoldenrodCity_Gym_GoldenrodCity_Gym_Text_LassCarrieAfter:
    .string "Do my POKéMON think I'm cute?$"

Johto_GoldenrodCity_Gym_GoldenrodCity_Gym_Text_LassBridgetSeen:
    .string "I like cute POKéMON better than\n"
    .string "strong POKéMON.\p"
    .string "But I have strong and cute POKéMON!$"

Johto_GoldenrodCity_Gym_GoldenrodCity_Gym_Text_LassBridgetBeaten:
    .string "Oh, no, no, no!$"

Johto_GoldenrodCity_Gym_GoldenrodCity_Gym_Text_LassBridgetAfter:
    .string "I'm trying to beat WHITNEY, but…\n"
    .string "It's depressing.\p"
    .string "I'm okay! If I lose, I'll just try\n"
    .string "harder next time!$"

Johto_GoldenrodCity_Gym_GoldenrodCity_Gym_Text_BridgetWhitneyCries:
    .string "Oh, no. You made WHITNEY cry.\p"
    .string "It's OK. She'll stop soon. She\n"
    .string "always cries when she loses.$"

Johto_GoldenrodCity_Gym_GoldenrodCity_Gym_Text_BeautyVictoriaSeen:
    .string "Oh, you are a cute little trainer!\p"
    .string "I like you, but I won't hold back!$"

Johto_GoldenrodCity_Gym_GoldenrodCity_Gym_Text_BeautyVictoriaBeaten:
    .string "Let's see… Oops, it's over?$"

Johto_GoldenrodCity_Gym_GoldenrodCity_Gym_Text_BeautyVictoriaAfter:
    .string "Wow, you must be good to beat me!\n"
    .string "Keep it up!$"

Johto_GoldenrodCity_Gym_GoldenrodCity_Gym_Text_BeautySamanthaSeen:
    .string "Give it your best shot, or I'll take\n"
    .string "you down!$"

Johto_GoldenrodCity_Gym_GoldenrodCity_Gym_Text_BeautySamanthaBeaten:
    .string "No! Oh, MEOWTH, I'm so sorry!$"

Johto_GoldenrodCity_Gym_GoldenrodCity_Gym_Text_BeautySamanthaAfter:
    .string "I taught MEOWTH moves for taking on\n"
    .string "any type…$"

Johto_GoldenrodCity_Gym_GoldenrodCity_Gym_Text_GymGuide:
    .string "Yo! CHAMP in making!\p"
    .string "This GYM is home to WHITNEY, the\n"
    .string "master of NORMAL-type POKéMON.\p"
    .string "Be cautious of her cute team.\p"
    .string "Some of the POKéMON in this gym\n"
    .string "have the newly discovered FAIRY\l"
    .string "type as well.\p"
    .string "Check ROUTE 34 if you need a\n"
    .string "FIGHTING-type or POISON-type.$"

Johto_GoldenrodCity_Gym_GoldenrodCity_Gym_Text_GymGuideWin:
    .string "You won? Great! I was busy admiring\n"
