Johto_GoldenrodCity_RadioTower_3F_GoldenrodCity_RadioTower_3F_Text_SuperNerd:
	.string "We have recordings of the cries\n"
	.string "of all POKéMON that have been\l"
	.string "found.\p"
	.string "We must have about 400 kinds.$"

Johto_GoldenrodCity_RadioTower_3F_GoldenrodCity_RadioTower_3F_Text_GymGuideRockets:
	.string "To trainers, POKéMON are their\n"
	.string "beloved partners.\p"
	.string "It's terrible how TEAM ROCKET is\n"
	.string "trying to control POKéMON.$"

Johto_GoldenrodCity_RadioTower_3F_GoldenrodCity_RadioTower_3F_Text_GymGuide:
	.string "We run 24 hours a day to broadcast\n"
	.string "entertaining programs.\p"
	.string "I'll do my best to run around the\n"
	.string "clock too!$"

Johto_GoldenrodCity_RadioTower_3F_GoldenrodCity_RadioTower_3F_Text_CooltrainerFPleaseSave:
	.string "The TEAM ROCKET boss has locked\n"
	.string "himself in.\p"
	.string "But the DIRECTOR can open it.\p"
	.string "He's up on the fifth floor.\p"
	.string "Please save him!$"

Johto_GoldenrodCity_RadioTower_3F_GoldenrodCity_RadioTower_3F_Text_CooltrainerFDirectorSafe:
	.string "Is the DIRECTOR safe?$"

Johto_GoldenrodCity_RadioTower_3F_GoldenrodCity_RadioTower_3F_Text_CooltrainerFHeroGift:
	.string "Thank you! You're my hero!\p"
	.string "This is a token of my appreciation.$"

Johto_GoldenrodCity_RadioTower_3F_GoldenrodCity_RadioTower_3F_Text_CooltrainerFSunnyDay:
	.string "It's SKILL SWAP. It swaps the ability\n"
	.string "of one POKéMON with another's.$"

Johto_GoldenrodCity_RadioTower_3F_GoldenrodCity_RadioTower_3F_Text_CooltrainerFMarvelous:
	.string "You were simply marvelous!$"

Johto_GoldenrodCity_RadioTower_3F_GoldenrodCity_RadioTower_3F_Text_GruntM7Seen:
	.string "I've been given strict orders.\p"
	.string "I'm to crush anyone who challenges\n"
	.string "TEAM ROCKET!$"

Johto_GoldenrodCity_RadioTower_3F_GoldenrodCity_RadioTower_3F_Text_GruntM7Beaten:
	.string "What?!$"

Johto_GoldenrodCity_RadioTower_3F_GoldenrodCity_RadioTower_3F_Text_GruntM7After:
	.string "I failed in my duties…\p"
	.string "ARCHER will be so upset...$"

Johto_GoldenrodCity_RadioTower_3F_GoldenrodCity_RadioTower_3F_Text_GruntM8Seen:
	.string "It feels great ordering POKéMON\n"
	.string "to commit crimes.$"

Johto_GoldenrodCity_RadioTower_3F_GoldenrodCity_RadioTower_3F_Text_GruntM8Beaten:
	.string "You're kidding!$"

Johto_GoldenrodCity_RadioTower_3F_GoldenrodCity_RadioTower_3F_Text_GruntM8After:
	.string "I feel lousy over losing!\p"
	.string "Darn it! I hate useless POKéMON!$"

Johto_GoldenrodCity_RadioTower_3F_GoldenrodCity_RadioTower_3F_Text_GruntM9Seen:
	.string "Why did the shutter open? Did you\n"
	.string "have something to do with this?$"

Johto_GoldenrodCity_RadioTower_3F_GoldenrodCity_RadioTower_3F_Text_GruntM9Beaten:
	.string "I'm done for!$"

Johto_GoldenrodCity_RadioTower_3F_GoldenrodCity_RadioTower_3F_Text_GruntM9After:
	.string "What?! You made it past our men in\n"
	.string "the UNDERGROUND?\p"
	.string "How could you?$"

Johto_GoldenrodCity_RadioTower_3F_GoldenrodCity_RadioTower_3F_Text_ScientistMarcSeen:
	.string "An unknown child wandering here?\p"
	.string "Who are you?$"

Johto_GoldenrodCity_RadioTower_3F_GoldenrodCity_RadioTower_3F_Text_ScientistMarcBeaten:
	.string "Tch! I took you too lightly!$"

Johto_GoldenrodCity_RadioTower_3F_GoldenrodCity_RadioTower_3F_Text_ScientistMarcAfter:
	.string "Bwahahaha…\p"
	.string "I can transmit as strong a signal\n"
	.string "as I need from here.$"


