Johto_GoldenrodCity_RadioTower_4F_GoldenrodCity_RadioTower_4F4_Text_Proton_Seen:
	.string "PROTON: Now wait just one second!\p"
	.string "Aren't you the one who got in our\n"
	.string "way at SLOWPOKE WELL?\p"
	.string "I see... You're doing all this\n"
	.string "because you want to make me angry.\l"
	.string "Be careful!\p"
	.string "But since you seem to wish it, I'll\n"
	.string "show you the full extent of a TEAM\l"
	.string "ROCKET EXECUTIVE's wrath!$"

Johto_GoldenrodCity_RadioTower_4F_GoldenrodCity_RadioTower_4F4_Text_Proton_Beaten:
	.string "Phew...$"

Johto_GoldenrodCity_RadioTower_4F_GoldenrodCity_RadioTower_4F4_Text_Proton_After:
	.string "PROTON: You may have won this\n"
	.string "time... But all you did was make\p"
	.string "TEAM ROCKET's wrath grow.$"

Johto_GoldenrodCity_RadioTower_4F_GoldenrodCity_RadioTower_4F4_Text_Fisher:
	.string "I listened to the radio while I was\n"
	.string "at the RUINS.\p"
	.string "I heard a strange broadcast there.$"

Johto_GoldenrodCity_RadioTower_4F_GoldenrodCity_RadioTower_4F4_Text_DJMary:
	.string "MARY: Why? Why do I have to suffer\n"
	.string "through this?\p"
	.string "MEOWTH, help me!$"

Johto_GoldenrodCity_RadioTower_4F_GoldenrodCity_RadioTower_4F4_Text_DJMaryCleared:
	.string "MARY: Oh! You're my little savior!\p"
	.string "Will you take this as my thanks?$"

Johto_GoldenrodCity_RadioTower_4F_GoldenrodCity_RadioTower_4F4_Text_DJMaryPinkBow:
	.string "MARY: It's good for dodging the\n"
	.string "enemy's attacks.$"

Johto_GoldenrodCity_RadioTower_4F_GoldenrodCity_RadioTower_4F4_Text_DJMaryAfter:
	.string "MARY: Please tune into me on PROF.\n"
	.string "OAK'S POKéMON TALK show!$"

Johto_GoldenrodCity_RadioTower_4F_GoldenrodCity_RadioTower_4F4_Text_Meowth:
	.string "MEOWTH: Meowth…$"

Johto_GoldenrodCity_RadioTower_4F_GoldenrodCity_RadioTower_4F4_Text_GruntM10Seen:
	.string "You plan to rescue the DIRECTOR?\p"
	.string "That won't be possible because I'm\n"
	.string "going to beat you!$"

Johto_GoldenrodCity_RadioTower_4F_GoldenrodCity_RadioTower_4F4_Text_GruntM10Beaten:
	.string "No! Unbelievable!$"

Johto_GoldenrodCity_RadioTower_4F_GoldenrodCity_RadioTower_4F4_Text_GruntM10After:
	.string "I don't believe it! I was beaten!$"

Johto_GoldenrodCity_RadioTower_4F_GoldenrodCity_RadioTower_4F4_Text_ExecutiveM2Seen:
	.string "Stop! I'm known as the TEAM ROCKET\n"
	.string "fortress!\p"
	.string "You're not taking another step!$"

Johto_GoldenrodCity_RadioTower_4F_GoldenrodCity_RadioTower_4F4_Text_ExecutiveM2Beaten:
	.string "The fortress came down!$"

Johto_GoldenrodCity_RadioTower_4F_GoldenrodCity_RadioTower_4F4_Text_ExecutiveM2After:
	.string "You've earned my respect, so here's\n"
	.string "some advice.\p"
	.string "It's not too late. You can still turn\n"
	.string "back.$"

Johto_GoldenrodCity_RadioTower_4F_GoldenrodCity_RadioTower_4F4_Text_GruntF4Seen:
	.string "Don't I think POKéMON are cute?\p"
	.string "I'll think my POKéMON are cute--\p"
	.string "after they beat yours!$"

Johto_GoldenrodCity_RadioTower_4F_GoldenrodCity_RadioTower_4F4_Text_GruntF4Beaten:
	.string "Oh, no! They're so useless!$"

Johto_GoldenrodCity_RadioTower_4F_GoldenrodCity_RadioTower_4F4_Text_GruntF4After:
	.string "I love my beautiful self!\p"
	.string "Who cares about POKéMON?$"

Johto_GoldenrodCity_RadioTower_4F_GoldenrodCity_RadioTower_4F4_Text_ScientistRichSeen:
	.string "Most excellent.\p"
	.string "This RADIO TOWER will fulfill our\n"
	.string "grand design.$"

Johto_GoldenrodCity_RadioTower_4F_GoldenrodCity_RadioTower_4F4_Text_ScientistRichBeaten:
	.string "Hmmm…\p"
	.string "All grand plans come with snags.$"

Johto_GoldenrodCity_RadioTower_4F_GoldenrodCity_RadioTower_4F4_Text_ScientistRichAfter:
	.string "Do you honestly believe you can stop\n"
	.string "TEAM ROCKET?$"

Johto_GoldenrodCity_RadioTower_4F_GoldenrodCity_RadioTower_4F4_Text_ProductionSign:
	.string "4F PRODUCTION$"

Johto_GoldenrodCity_RadioTower_4F_GoldenrodCity_RadioTower_4F4_Text_Studio2Sign:
