	.string "SPECIAL DEFENSE.\p"
	.string "…Um… Please take this too…$"

Johto_OlivineCity_Gym_OlivineCity_Gym_Text_JasmineIronTailSpeech:
	.string "…You could use that TM to teach\n"
	.string "IRON TAIL.$"

Johto_OlivineCity_Gym_OlivineCity_Gym_Text_JasmineGoodLuck:
	.string "Um… I don't know how to say this,\n"
	.string "but good luck…$"

Johto_OlivineCity_Gym_OlivineCity_Gym_Text_JasmineRematchText:
