	.string "back?$"

Johto_CianwoodHouse3_CianwoodCity_Text_ManiacHowsdoing:
	.string "Hi! How's my POKéMON?$"

Johto_CianwoodHouse3_CianwoodCity_Text_ManiacAskReturn:
	.string "Hi! How's my POKéMON?\p"
	.string "I think I'm safe now, so may I\n"
	.string "have it back?$"

Johto_CianwoodHouse3_CianwoodCity_Text_ManiacThankYou:
	.string "Thank you!$"

Johto_CianwoodHouse3_CianwoodCity_Text_ManiacShuckleNotThere:
