	.string "All right, you should keep it.\p"
	.string "But promise to be good to it!$"

Johto_CianwoodHouse3_CianwoodCity_Text_ManiacRobbed:
	.string "Huh, something's not right.$"

Johto_CianwoodHouse3_CianwoodCity_Text_ManiacRobbed2:
	.string "Oh, no, no… That's the same as\n"
	.string "being robbed.$"

Johto_CianwoodHouse3_CianwoodCity_Text_ManiacHappinessSpeech:
