Johto_UnionCave_1F_UnionCave_1F_Text_HikerRussellSeen:
	.string "You're headed to AZALEA, are you?\p"
	.string "Let my POKéMON see if you are good\n"
	.string "enough to battle.$"

Johto_UnionCave_1F_UnionCave_1F_Text_HikerRussellBeaten:
	.string "Oh, oh, oh!$"

Johto_UnionCave_1F_UnionCave_1F_Text_HikerRussellAfter:
	.string "All right, then! I've decided.\p"
	.string "I'm not leaving until my POKéMON\n"
	.string "get tougher!$"

Johto_UnionCave_1F_UnionCave_1F_Text_PokemaniacLarrySeen:
	.string "I roam far and wide in search of\n"
	.string "POKéMON.\p"
	.string "Are you looking for POKéMON too?\p"
	.string "Then you're my collecting rival!$"

Johto_UnionCave_1F_UnionCave_1F_Text_PokemaniacLarryBeaten:
	.string "Ugh. My poor POKéMON…$"

Johto_UnionCave_1F_UnionCave_1F_Text_PokemaniacLarryAfter:
	.string "Every Friday, you can hear POKéMON\n"
	.string "roars from deep inside the cave.$"

Johto_UnionCave_1F_UnionCave_1F_Text_HikerDanielSeen:
	.string "Whoa! What a surprise!\p"
	.string "I didn't expect to see anyone here!$"

Johto_UnionCave_1F_UnionCave_1F_Text_HikerDanielBeaten:
	.string "Whoa! I'm beaten big time!$"

Johto_UnionCave_1F_UnionCave_1F_Text_HikerDanielAfter:
	.string "I was conned into buying a\n"
	.string "SLOWPOKETAIL.\p"
	.string "I feel sorry for the poor POKéMON.$"

Johto_UnionCave_1F_UnionCave_1F_Text_FirebreatherBillSeen:
	.string "ZUBAT's SUPERSONIC keeps confusing\n"
	.string "my POKéMON.\p"
	.string "I'm seriously upset about that!$"

Johto_UnionCave_1F_UnionCave_1F_Text_FirebreatherBillBeaten:
	.string "I flamed out!$"

Johto_UnionCave_1F_UnionCave_1F_Text_FirebreatherBillAfter:
	.string "On weekends, you can hear strange\n"
	.string "roars from deep in the cave.$"

Johto_UnionCave_1F_UnionCave_1F_Text_FirebreatherRaySeen:
	.string "If it's light, a cave isn't scary.\p"
	.string "If you're strong, POKéMON aren't\n"
	.string "scary.$"

Johto_UnionCave_1F_UnionCave_1F_Text_FirebreatherRayBeaten:
	.string "FLASH!$"

Johto_UnionCave_1F_UnionCave_1F_Text_FirebreatherRayAfter:
	.string "It's my POKéMON's fire that lights\n"
	.string "up this cave.$"

