Johto_DragonsDen_Shrine_DragonsDen_Shrine_Text_ClairYouPassed:
    .string "So how did it go?\p"
    .string "I guess there's no point\n"
	.string "in asking. You did fail?\p"
    .string "..................................\p"
    .string "…What? You passed?$"

Johto_DragonsDen_Shrine_DragonsDen_Shrine_Text_ClairThatCantBe:
    .string "That can't be!$"

Johto_DragonsDen_Shrine_DragonsDen_Shrine_Text_ClairYoureLying:
    .string "You're lying!\p"
    .string "Even I haven't been approved!$"

Johto_DragonsDen_Shrine_DragonsDen_Shrine_Text_MustIInformLance:
    .string "CLAIR!\p"
    .string "This child is impeccable,\n"
    .string "in skill and spirit!\p"
    .string "Admit defeat and confer the\n"
    .string "RISINGBADGE!\p"
    .string "…Or must I inform LANCE of this?$"

Johto_DragonsDen_Shrine_DragonsDen_Shrine_Text_IUnderstand:
    .string "I-I understand…$"

Johto_DragonsDen_Shrine_DragonsDen_Shrine_Text_HereRisingBadge:
    .string "Here, this is the RISINGBADGE…\p"
    .string "Hurry up! Take it!$"

Johto_DragonsDen_Shrine_DragonsDen_Shrine_Text_PlayerReceivedRisingBadge:
    .string "{PLAYER} received RISINGBADGE.$"

Johto_DragonsDen_Shrine_DragonsDen_Shrine_Text_RisingBadgeExplanation:
    .string "RISINGBADGE will enable your\n"
    .string "POKéMON to use the move for\l"
    .string "climbing waterfalls.\p"
    .string "Also, all POKéMON will recognize\n"
    .string "you as a trainer and obey your\l"
    .string "every command without question.$"

Johto_DragonsDen_Shrine_DragonsDen_Shrine_Text_ElderScoldsClair:
    .string "CLAIR…\p"
    .string "Reflect upon what it is that you\n"
    .string "lack and this child has.$"

Johto_DragonsDen_Shrine_DragonsDen_Shrine_Text_Speechless:
    .string "..................................$"

Johto_DragonsDen_Shrine_DragonsDen_Shrine_Text_ComeAgain:
    .string "Come again, if you so desire.$"

Johto_DragonsDen_Shrine_DragonsDen_Shrine_Text_SilverIsInTraining:
    .string "A boy close to your age is in\n"
    .string "training here.\p"
    .string "He is much like CLAIR when she was\n"
    .string "younger. It is a little worrisome…$"

Johto_DragonsDen_Shrine_DragonsDen_Shrine_EventScript_Elder2::
	msgbox Johto_DragonsDen_Shrine_DragonsDen_Shrine_Text_Elder2, MSGBOX_NPC
	end

Johto_DragonsDen_Shrine_DragonsDen_Shrine_EventScript_Elder3::
	msgbox Johto_DragonsDen_Shrine_DragonsDen_Shrine_Text_Elder3, MSGBOX_NPC
	end

Johto_DragonsDen_Shrine_DragonsDen_Shrine_Text_Elder2:
    .string "It's been quite some time since a\n"
    .string "trainer has gained our MASTER's\l"
    .string "rare approval.\p"
    .string "In fact, not since Master LANCE.$"

Johto_DragonsDen_Shrine_DragonsDen_Shrine_Text_Elder3:
    .string "You know young Master LANCE?\p"
    .string "He looks so much like our MASTER\n"
    .string "did in his youth.\p"
    .string "It's in their blood.$"

Johto_DragonsDen_Shrine_DragonsDen_Shrine_EventScript_ElderChooseDratini::
	goto_if_eq JOHTO_VAR_DRAGONS_DEN_QUIZ, 0, Johto_DragonsDen_Shrine_DragonsDen_Shrine_EventScript_ElderGiveSpecialDratini
	goto Johto_DragonsDen_Shrine_DragonsDen_Shrine_EventScript_ElderGiveBasicDratini

Johto_DragonsDen_Shrine_DragonsDen_Shrine_EventScript_ElderGiveBasicDratini::
