	.string "in the trees, but it didn't\l"
	.string "look like MANKEY...$"

KantoLater_Route11_Route11_Text_YoungsterOwenSeen:
	.string "There's no cheating in POKéMON.\p"
	.string "Let's keep it fair and square!$"

KantoLater_Route11_Route11_Text_YoungsterOwenBeaten:
	.string "Huh? How did this happen?$"

KantoLater_Route11_Route11_Text_YoungsterOwenAfterBattle:
	.string "I fought fair and square with\n"
	.string "honor.\p"
	.string "I don't regret this at all.$"

KantoLater_Route11_Route11_Text_YoungsterJasonSeen:
	.string "It itches and tickles a bit when\n"
	.string "I wear shorts in the grass.$"

KantoLater_Route11_Route11_Text_YoungsterJasonBeaten:
	.string "Aiyaaah! I got stomped!$"

KantoLater_Route11_Route11_Text_YoungsterJasonAfterBattle:
	.string "I'm going to catch more POKéMON in\n"
	.string "the grass.$"

KantoLater_Route11_Route11_Text_PsychicHermanSeen:
	.string "…$"

KantoLater_Route11_Route11_Text_PsychicHermanBeaten:
	.string "…$"

KantoLater_Route11_Route11_Text_PsychicHermanAfterBattle:
	.string "…\p"
	.string "I lost while I had my eyes closed…$"

KantoLater_Route11_Route11_Text_PsychicFidelSeen:
	.string "I can see it…\p"
	.string "Everything to see about you…$"

KantoLater_Route11_Route11_Text_PsychicFidelBeaten:
	.string "I couldn't foresee your power…$"

KantoLater_Route11_Route11_Text_PsychicFidelAfterBattle:
	.string "Strength in conviction…\p"
	.string "You're strong because you believe\n"
	.string "in your POKéMON.$"

