	.string "POKéMON, but PIKACHU\l"
	.string "is still the best.$"

KantoLater_Route13_Route13_Text_BirdKeeperPerrySeen:
	.string "Agility is the key attribute of\n"
	.string "bird POKéMON.$"

KantoLater_Route13_Route13_Text_BirdKeeperPerryBeaten:
	.string "You beat me with your speed…$"

KantoLater_Route13_Route13_Text_BirdKeeperPerryAfterBattle:
	.string "Your POKéMON are remarkably well-\n"
	.string "trained.$"

KantoLater_Route13_Route13_Text_BirdKeeperBretSeen:
	.string "Check out my POKéMON. Just look\n"
	.string "at their coloring and their\l"
	.string "plumage.$"

KantoLater_Route13_Route13_Text_BirdKeeperBretBeaten:
	.string "Shoot! Not good enough!$"

KantoLater_Route13_Route13_Text_BirdKeeperBretAfterBattle:
	.string "If you groom them, POKéMON get\n"
	.string "happy.$"

KantoLater_Route13_Route13_Text_HikerKennySeen:
	.string "I should go to ROCK TUNNEL to get\n"
	.string "myself an ONIX.$"

KantoLater_Route13_Route13_Text_HikerKennyBeaten:
	.string "I lost…$"

KantoLater_Route13_Route13_Text_HikerKennyAfterBattle:
	.string "Geological features don't appear\n"
	.string "to change.\p"
	.string "But they actually change, little\n"
	.string "by little.$"

KantoLater_Route13_Route13_Text_TrainerTips:
