KantoLater_Route14_Route14_Text_Eusine:
	.string "EUSINE: {PLAYER}! Not again!\n"
	.string "I'll be there first next time!\p"
	.string "Having followed it here, I'm\n"
	.string "starting to understand what SUICUNE\l"
	.string "is after.\p"
	.string "To be honest, I would like to keep\n"
	.string "this information to myself.\p"
	.string "But I want to be an honest trainer\n"
	.string "in front of SUICUNE!\p"
	.string "That's why I am sharing a clue with\n"
	.string "you.\p"
	.string "It seems that...\n"
	.string "SUICUNE prefers a hilly place...\l"
	.string "Near water...\l"
	.string "Somewhere north...\p"
	.string "I don't know exactly where yet.\n"
	.string "It will just be you and me!\p"
	.string "Who'll find it first?\n"
	.string "I challenge you!$"

KantoLater_Route14_Route14_Text_PokefanmCarterSeen:
	.string "Let me tell you, I had a hard time\n"
	.string "catching my prized POKéMON.$"

KantoLater_Route14_Route14_Text_PokefanmCarterBeaten:
	.string "Awaaah!$"

KantoLater_Route14_Route14_Text_PokefanmCarterAfterBattle:
	.string "TOTODILE, CYNDAQUIL, CHIKORITA…\p"
	.string "I think that's a well-balanced mix.$"

KantoLater_Route14_Route14_Text_BirdKeeperRoySeen:
	.string "My dream is to fly with my beloved\n"
	.string "bird POKéMON.$"

KantoLater_Route14_Route14_Text_BirdKeeperRoyBeaten:
	.string "I can dream, but I can't ever fly…$"

KantoLater_Route14_Route14_Text_BirdKeeperRoyAfterBattle:
	.string "You have POKéMON that know the HM\n"
	.string "move FLY, don't you? I envy you.$"

KantoLater_Route14_Route14_Text_PokefanmTrevorSeen:
	.string "Hi. Did you know…?\p"
	.string "POKéMON get more friendly if you\n"
	.string "train them in a place that they\l"
	.string "remember.$"

KantoLater_Route14_Route14_Text_PokefanmTrevorBeaten:
	.string "Where did I meet this SCIZOR?$"

KantoLater_Route14_Route14_Text_PokefanmTrevorAfterBattle:
	.string "If only there were an easy way to\n"
	.string "identify where I got my POKéMON…$"

KantoLater_Route14_Route14_EventScript_Pidgeotto::
	lockall
	faceplayer
	playmoncry SPECIES_PIDGEOTTO, CRY_MODE_NORMAL
	msgbox KantoLater_Route14_Route14_Text_Pidgeotto, MSGBOX_DEFAULT
	waitmoncry
	goto_if_set JOHTO_FLAG_GOT_ROUTE_14_AERIAL_ACE, KantoLater_Route14_Route14_EventScript_PidgeottoBlowPlayer
	msgbox KantoLater_Route14_Route14_Text_PidgeottoBerry, MSGBOX_YESNO
	goto_if_eq JOHTO_VAR_RESULT, FALSE, KantoLater_Route14_Route14_EventScript_PidgeottoBlowPlayer
	fadescreen FADE_TO_BLACK
	closemessage
	special Bag_ChooseBerry
	waitstate
	goto_if_eq VAR_ITEM_ID, 0, KantoLater_Route14_Route14_EventScript_PidgeottoBlowPlayer
	removeitem JOHTO_VAR_ITEM_ID, 1
	goto_if_ne JOHTO_VAR_ITEM_ID, ITEM_QUALOT_BERRY, KantoLater_Route14_Route14_EventScript_PidgeottoDislikedBerry
	msgbox KantoLater_Route14_Route14_Text_PidgeottoAteBerry, MSGBOX_DEFAULT
	giveitem ITEM_TM_AERIAL_ACE
	setflag JOHTO_FLAG_GOT_ROUTE_14_AERIAL_ACE
