KantoLater_Route25_Route25_Text_MistyDate:
	.string "MISTY: Aww! Why did you have to\n"
	.string "show up and bug us now?\p"
	.string "Do you know what they call\n"
	.string "people like you?\p"
	.string "Pests! You heard me right,\n"
	.string "pest!\p"
	.string "…\p"
	.string "…Oh? Those BADGES you have…\n"
	.string "Are they JOHTO GYM BADGES?\p"
	.string "If you have eight, you must be\n"
	.string "good.\p"
	.string "OK, then. Come to CERULEAN GYM.\p"
	.string "I'll be happy to take you on.\p"
	.string "I'm MISTY, the GYM LEADER in\n"
	.string "CERULEAN.$"

KantoLater_Route25_Route25_Text_SchoolboyDudleySeen:
	.string "Beat the six of us trainers to\n"
	.string "win a fabulous prize!\p"
	.string "Think you've got what it takes?$"

KantoLater_Route25_Route25_Text_SchoolboyDudleyBeaten:
	.string "Whoo! Good stuff.$"

KantoLater_Route25_Route25_Text_SchoolboyDudleyAfter:
	.string "I did my best.\n"
	.string "I have no regrets.$"

KantoLater_Route25_Route25_Text_LassEllenSeen:
	.string "I'm second.\n"
	.string "Now it's serious!$"

KantoLater_Route25_Route25_Text_LassEllenBeaten:
	.string "How could I lose?$"

KantoLater_Route25_Route25_Text_LassEllenAfter:
	.string "I did my best.\n"
	.string "I have no regrets.$"

KantoLater_Route25_Route25_Text_SchoolboyJoeSeen:
	.string "Here's No. 3!\n"
	.string "I won't be easy.$"

KantoLater_Route25_Route25_Text_SchoolboyJoeBeaten:
	.string "Ow! Stomped flat!$"

KantoLater_Route25_Route25_Text_SchoolboyJoeAfter:
	.string "I did my best.\n"
	.string "I have no regrets.$"

KantoLater_Route25_Route25_Text_LassLauraSeen:
	.string "I'm No. 4!\n"
	.string "Getting tired?$"

KantoLater_Route25_Route25_Text_LassLauraBeaten:
	.string "I lost too…$"

KantoLater_Route25_Route25_Text_LassLauraAfter:
	.string "I did my best.\n"
	.string "I have no regrets.$"

KantoLater_Route25_Route25_Text_CamperLloydSeen:
	.string "OK! I'm No. 5.\n"
	.string "I'll stomp you!$"

KantoLater_Route25_Route25_Text_CamperLloydBeaten:
	.string "Whoa! Too much.$"

KantoLater_Route25_Route25_Text_CamperLloydAfter:
	.string "I did my best.\n"
	.string "I have no regrets.$"

KantoLater_Route25_Route25_Text_LassShannonSeen:
	.string "I'm the last in line, but I tell\n"
	.string "you, I'm tough!$"

KantoLater_Route25_Route25_Text_LassShannonBeaten:
	.string "You're kidding.$"

KantoLater_Route25_Route25_Text_LassShannonAfter:
	.string "I did my best.\n"
	.string "I have no regrets.$"

KantoLater_Route25_Route25_Text_SupernerdPatSeen:
	.string "Mufufufu…\p"
	.string "I have nothing to do with the\n"
	.string "six-pack trainers.\p"
	.string "I waited here to beat you when\n"
	.string "you were tired out by all the\l"
	.string "battles.$"

KantoLater_Route25_Route25_Text_SupernerdPatBeaten:
	.string "Aren't you tired at all?$"

KantoLater_Route25_Route25_Text_SupernerdPatAfter:
	.string "I'm sorry… I won't cheat\n"
	.string "anymore…$"

KantoLater_Route25_Route25_Text_CooltrainerKevinNugget:
	.string "You took on one more battle than\n"
	.string "you expected, but you won\l"
	.string "anyway.\p"
	.string "As promised, you win a prize.$"

KantoLater_Route25_Route25_Text_CooltrainerKevinSeen:
	.string "But after seeing how you battle,\n"
	.string "I want to see how I'll fare.\p"
	.string "How about it? Let me take you\n"
	.string "on.$"

KantoLater_Route25_Route25_Text_CooltrainerKevinBeaten:
	.string "I've never had a battle this\n"
	.string "good!$"

KantoLater_Route25_Route25_Text_CooltrainerKevinAfter:
	.string "That was a great battle!\p"
	.string "You and your POKéMON are truly\n"
	.string "outstanding!$"

KantoLater_Route25_Route25_Text_BillsHouseSign:
	.string "SEA COTTAGE\n"
	.string "BILL'S HOUSE$"


