	case 3, KantoLater_VermilionCity_PortInside_VermilionPort_EventScript_ChoseFarawayIsland
	case 4, KantoLater_VermilionCity_PortInside_VermilionPort_EventScript_ChoseBattleFrontier
	case 5, KantoLater_VermilionCity_PortInside_VermilionPort_EventScript_Sailor_Refused
